   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Compare and contrast humoral and hormonal stimuli.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1071552,
     "content_html": "Both humoral and hormonal stimuli release proteins. Humoral stimuli are hormones that stimulate other hormones, whereas hormonal stimuli are extracellular fluid-related stimuli."
    },
